  "description": "The capacity of the on grid power plant is 5kW and produces 20 units per day. Ideal for homes having electricity bill . Its working is as follows: 1. Solar Panels on your Rooftop Transform Sunlight into Direct Current (DC) Electricity. 2. Grid Tie Inverter Simply turns this DC Electricity into Alternating Current (AC) Electricity. This Inverter is connected to your Homes Electrical Panel to power your Appliances. 3. During Day time, if your Solar System is creating more Power than your Home needs, the Extra Energy goes into your Power Grid (MSEB). At Night MSEB provides you Electricity as usual. The Bidirectional Energy Meter measures the Energy you draw and feed back to the Grid. The Excess Energy You Export will be paid by MSEB.",
